Package: tundraux3-bundled-experimental
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TundraUX3 contributors <maintainers@tundraux3.invalid>
Depends: xdg-utils, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: dbus-user-session, xdg-desktop-portal, policykit-1, xwayland
Description: TundraUX3 with a private WezTerm runtime (experimental)
 This experimental channel provides one public launcher, a pinned private
 WezTerm runtime, the full-screen Tundra Shell and its management CLI. It does
 not open a system terminal or use a user-installed WezTerm.
